    "Fisher, B. et al. (1985). Five-year results of a randomized clinical trial comparing total mastectomy and segmental mastectomy with or without radiation. <em>New England Journal of Medicine</em>, 312, 665–673.",
    "Bray, F. et al. (2024). Global cancer statistics 2022: GLOBOCAN estimates of incidence and mortality worldwide for 36 cancers in 185 countries. <em>CA: A Cancer Journal for Clinicians</em>, 74, 229–263.",
